## Approach

Create a `ConstraintResolver` struct in `src/constraints/resolver.rs` that translates authored constraints into file-level `(i64, i64)` forbidden pairs for `DdEngine::set_forbidden_pairs`. Boundary constraints join against `component_membership` via `Db`; ForbiddenDep constraints resolve via glob matching against a path map. The resolver caches its output and invalidates when `clustering_meta.clustered_at` changes (the signal that component membership was re-derived).

