- **Create**: `src/constraints/resolver.rs` — `ConstraintResolver` struct, `resolve()` method, internal cache, component lookup helper
- **Modify**: `src/constraints/mod.rs` (lines 1-4) — add `mod resolver;` and `pub use resolver::ConstraintResolver;`
- **Create**: `tests/resolver-test.rs` — integration tests with real Db + component_membership setup

